* FastHenry-format example: a straight 10 cm copper wire, 1x1 mm cross-section.
* Frequency sweep 1 Hz .. 1 GHz, 5 filaments per side to resolve skin effect.
.units m
N1 x=0    y=0 z=0
N2 x=0.1  y=0 z=0
E1 N1 N2 w=0.001 h=0.001 sigma=5.8e7 nhinc=5 nwinc=5
.external N1 N2 port1
.freq fmin=1 fmax=1e9 ndec=1
.end
